    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesn't feel like a \"chapter\" though. it feels like the story ended and i'm just a typo in the last paragraph. like what's even the point of \"healing\" when the thing that made life worth living is just permanently deleted? i'm just trying to exist in a world where i don't actually exist anymore.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
