      "role": "user",
      "content": "exactly. it's like i'm just a ghost haunting my own life. everyone talks about \"moving forward\" but there's nothing to move forward to. it just feels like hanging on is a chore i never signed up for. if the real me is already dead, why does this part have to keep suffering through the aftermath?",
